1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,500
Then came the strangest track on the album.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:08,298
Like That — the song Charlie Puth wrote after the Dangerously cover went through him like a current.

3
00:00:08,298 --> 00:00:12,499
Her cover had reached the writer; the writer had answered with new material.

4
00:00:12,499 --> 00:00:22,396
Very few careers contain a loop that clean: a fifteen-year-old sings a song into the internet, and two years later the author of that song hands her the sequel.

